League of Angels: Pact will go offline and be updated to the latest version from 21:00-21:30, Nov.27th (EST). Thank you for constantly supporting League of Angels: Pact. 
Updates:
1. Added guild rename function;
2. Added the function of displaying Angel skin on the player profile card;
3. Added the function of comparing the combat power of players' pets;
4. Added the function of removing teammates in the Team Dungeon;
5. Added Angel equipment material items to special gift packs;
Fixed bug: Tarrot Cosmos Angel skills display problems;
